  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Academic and Community Integration of Youth in El Salvador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de integracin acadmica y comunitaria para jvenes en El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la continuidad educativa media y postsecundaria de los jvenes estudiantes salvadoreos en situacin de vulnerabilidad. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer e incrementar acceso a los servicios de apoyo para el desarrollo de las competencias acadmicas y socioemocionales de los estudiantes de educacin media; (ii) incrementar el acceso a educacin postsecundaria de jvenes estudiantes del sector pblico y migrantes retornados y (iii) fortalecer las capacidades institucionales del pas para el monitoreo y el acompaamiento de trayectorias educativas postsecundarias.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve educational continuity in secondary and postsecondary education for vulnerable young Salvadoran students. The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen and increase access to support services for the development of academic and social-emotional skills among secondary school students; (ii) to increase access to postsecondary education for young students in the public sector and returning migrants; and (iii) to strengthen the country&apos;s institutional capacities for monitoring and supporting postsecondary educational pathways.</narrative>
  </description>
